WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Welcome to our training fix inactive or suppressed listings.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.555
The Fix Your Products page in Seller Central helps you review and address issues causing your listings

00:00:10.555 --> 00:00:13.760
to be inactive or suppressed from customer search results.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:20.500
To access the Fix Your Products page, select the menu icon in the top left corner of Seller Central.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.500
Hover over Inventory and select Manage Inventory.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:31.161
Then, click Search Suppressed and Inactive Listings in the Listings Tools section of the Manage

00:00:31.161 --> 00:00:32.020
Inventory page.

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:37.140
On the left side of the Fix Your Products page, you'll see current listing issues.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:42.060
You can sort them by the completed with issues or incomplete listings filters.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:48.108
Completed with issues listings are those that you've submitted and that we've accepted into the

00:00:48.108 --> 00:00:53.220
Amazon catalog but are either no longer buyable or no longer displayable to customers.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:59.529
Incomplete listings are those that you've submitted but that we haven't accepted into the Amazon

00:00:59.529 --> 00:01:01.700
catalog because they require more information.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.340
Below these options, you'll see your current number of inactive search suppressed and at-risk listings.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:14.180
To learn more about these categories, select the question mark icon next to each section's title.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:19.700
Suppressed listings, for example, are products we've removed from the Amazon store.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.240
Suppressions typically happen due to the product being a potential duplicate or missing a product

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:28.760
detail page requirement like a main image with a white background.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:35.683
You can also use the page's search field as well as the fulfillment, date of change and fixability

00:01:35.683 --> 00:01:38.760
filters to locate a specific product or issue.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:45.960
When you're ready to address a listing issue, you can do so directly from the Fix Your Products

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:46.360
page.

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:50.440
Here are some examples of issues you can address from this page.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:56.031
You can add a missing core detail page requirement like a product description or a compliant main

00:01:56.031 --> 00:01:56.360
image.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:03.811
You can address out-of-stock SKUs by updating the quantity or selecting restock or you can review

00:02:03.811 --> 00:02:05.080
a potential duplicate.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:11.929
If you determine the listings shown are not duplicates, choose these are not duplicates to fix the

00:02:11.929 --> 00:02:12.280
issue.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:17.960
Most inactive or suppressed listings will go live about 15 minutes after you fix them.

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:23.320
But certain scenarios may take longer to resolve since they require human review.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:28.520
These scenarios can include reviewing listings that are blocked or require approval.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:34.387
Your listing may require additional steps for reactivation that aren't currently included on the

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:35.880
Fix Your Products page.

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:42.388
If your listing remains inactive after fixing the issue, revisit the page to check if additional

00:02:42.388 --> 00:02:44.920
steps are required to reactivate the listing.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:51.126
We also recommend checking the Fix Your Product page regularly to help ensure that customers can

00:02:51.126 --> 00:02:52.840
find and purchase your products.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:59.400
This concludes our video on how to fix your inactive or search suppressed listings in Seller Central.

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:02.920
Thank you and happy selling in the Amazon store.
